Upstream was originally based on claude-agent-sdk-pi by Prateek Sunal,
https://github.com/prateekmedia/claude-agent-sdk-pi.

Adapted portions include the Claude Code provider, transcript conversion,
session synchronization, MCP tool bridge, prompt projection, streaming,
usage reporting, and isolated summary queries. Felan removes the legacy
delegation tool, supplies extension settings and storage paths, imports Pi
through Agent Core, and loads the separately managed SDK at runtime.

The proprietary Claude Agent SDK and Claude Code executable are not bundled
or dependencies of this package. Their optional managed installation is
subject to Anthropic's terms. The managed MCP SDK is loaded from the same
installation as the Claude Agent SDK.
